:sfz2b:00100000:FF8988:00000406:FFFFFFFF:Shoryuu Ken:dp+P
:sfz2b:00100000:FF8990:00000406:FFFFFFFF:Tatsumaki Senpuu Kyaku:qcb+K (air)
